  "contentHtml": "<h2>Noah Smith and Azeem Azhar discuss the AI boom</h2>\n<p><span>Azeem Azhar of </span><a href=\"https://www.exponentialview.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Exponential View</a><span> is an excellent blogger whom I tend to cite a lot. So it was very fun to call him up and talk to him about the AI boom, and the possibility of an AI bust! The discussion was sparked by this post of mine a few weeks ago:</span></p>\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vYOA!,w_140,h_140,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6954c481-0787-4359-90fd-1ce2f1075daf_1536x1258.jpeg\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" alt=\"AI vs. the railroads\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<h4>AI vs. the railroads</h4>\n<p>I don’t think we reached any firm conclusions, but it was fun to mull these issues over. Expect more discussions between me and Azeem in the future!</p>\n<hr>\n<h4>Discussion about this video</h4>\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8THZ!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F223841880%2Fd2e2e5a6-b2d5-4bd8-a4eb-8f856d0f5ee5%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bood!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F181305080%2F5f00365c-5fe2-4f4f-af73-9f5e0de18c57%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!U-zF!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F166417463%2Ff3519320-1114-477b-8cd2-6787edaa212f%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!udgV!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F164124607%2Fa9385120-8d0f-4388-be68-51d8f05c7ee2%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vm0R!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F164497060%2F29e499fa-cbde-4dec-9434-94e20a55afa5%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yQHY!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F156207872%2F08e43bb4-88c2-4202-92cf-ade50cc75cab%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mhaJ!,w_150,h_150,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-video.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fvideo_upload%2Fpost%2F155788070%2F1c2914b1-4aa8-4039-be23-394897daad79%2Ftranscoded-00001.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">",
